# DSA EXAM PORTAL - HOW TO START AFTER REBOOT

============================================================
OPTION 1: ONE-CLICK START (RECOMMENDED)
============================================================
1. Open Docker Desktop.
2. Double-click "start.bat" in this folder.
   (It starts Docker containers, Backend on port 4000, and Frontend on port 3000 in separate windows).

============================================================
OPTION 2: MANUAL TERMINAL COMMANDS
============================================================

--- STEP 1: Ensure Docker Desktop is Running ---
Make sure Docker Desktop is open.

--- STEP 2: Start Code Execution Engine (Judge0 + Redis) ---
Open PowerShell in the project root:
cd "c:\Users\saiak\Downloads\dsa portal"
docker compose up -d

(Note: If 'docker' command isn't recognized, run:
& "C:\Program Files\Docker\Docker\resources\bin\docker.exe" compose up -d)

--- STEP 3: Start Backend API (Port 4000) ---
Open a new PowerShell terminal:
cd "c:\Users\saiak\Downloads\dsa portal\backend"
npm run dev

--- STEP 4: Start Frontend Portal (Port 3000) ---
Open another new PowerShell terminal:
cd "c:\Users\saiak\Downloads\dsa portal\frontend"
npm run dev

